    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d25">

                <pb facs="0131" n="11" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg11"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Costa Rican Minister of Foreign
                            Affairs to the Acting Secretary of
                            State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San Jose, Costa Rica</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-07-03"><hi rendition="#italic">July 3,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>My government expresses to that of your excellency its heartfelt regrets at the
                    death of Secretary Hay.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">José Astua
                    Aguilar</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
